      "source": "https://cityofhardtner.com/About-Us/History"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "On June 2, 1929, an F2 tornado struck Hardtner, tracking 12.2 miles and producing some of the earliest high‑quality tornado photographs.",
